group":"performance","info":{"value":"\u003Cp\u003EWe analyse the traffic on this website and the behaviour of users to verify whether it fulfils its purpose and to improve it.\u0026nbsp;For this purpose, we use the open source analytics platform Matomo, hosted at\u0026nbsp;\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/matomo.mercator-ocean.fr\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003Ehttps:\/\/matomo.mercator-ocean.fr\u003C\/a\u003E,\u0026nbsp;which is configured to not collect any information that could identify individual persons.\u003C\/p\u003E\r\n\r\n\u003Cp\u003EMatomo uses optional 1st party cookies to improve the accuracy of web statistics.\u0026nbsp;Find out detailed information \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/matomo.org\/faq\/general\/faq_146\/\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003Ehere\u003C\/a\u003E.\u003C\/p\u003E\r\n\r\n\u003Ctable\u003E\r\n\u003Cthead\u003E\r\n\u003Ctr\u003E\r\n\t\u003Cth width=\u002215%\u0022\u003ECookie name\u003C\/th\u003E\r\n\t\u003Cth width=\u002215%\u0022\u003EDefault expiration time\u003C\/th\u003E\r\n\t\u003Cth\u003EDescription\u003C\/th\u003E\r\n\u003C\/tr\u003E\r\n\u003C\/thead\u003E\r\n\u003Ctbody\u003E\r\n\u003Ctr\u003E\r\n\t\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode dir=\u0022ltr\u0022 translate=\u0022no\u0022\u003E_pk_id*\u003C\/code\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\r\n\t\u003Ctd\u003E13 months\u003C\/td\u003E\r\n\t\u003Ctd\u003EUsed to store a few details about the user such as the unique visitor ID, to identify returning visitors.\u003C\/td\u003E\r\n\u003C\/tr\u003E\r\n\u003Ctr\u003E\r\n\t\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode dir=\u0022ltr\u0022 translate=\u0022no\u0022\u003E_pk_ses*\u003C\/code\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\r\n\t\u003Ctd\u003E30 minutes\u003C\/td\u003E\r\n\t\u003Ctd\u003E\r\n\t\u003Cp\u003EShort lived cookies used to temporarily store data for the visit.\u003C\/p\u003E\r\n\t\u003C\/td\u003E\r\n\u003C\/tr\u003E\r\n\u003Ctr\u003E\r\n\t\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode dir=\u0022ltr\u0022 translate=\u0022no\u0022\u003E_pk_ref*\u003C\/code\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\r\n\t\u003Ctd\u003E6 months\u003C\/td\u003E\r\n\t\u003Ctd\u003EUsed to store the\u0026nbsp;\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/matomo.org\/faq\/general\/faq_106\/\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003Eattribution\u003C\/a\u003E\u0026nbsp;information, the referrer initially used to visit the website\u003C\/td\u003E\r\n\u003C\/tr\u003E\r\n\u003C\/tbody\u003E\r\n\u003C\/table\u003E\r\n\r\n\u003Cp\u003EPlease note that refusing Matomo cookies will not prevent us from gathering web statistics. To completely opt-out of being included in our aggregated statistics, use the checkbox below.\u003C\/p\u003E\r\n\r\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ciframe src=\u0022https:\/\/matomo.mercator-ocean.fr\/index.php?module=CoreAdminHome\u0026amp;action=optOut\u0026amp;language=en\u0026amp;fontFamily=Lato\u0022 style=\u0022border: 0\u0022 width=\u0022100%\u0022\u003E\u003C\/iframe\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\r\n","format":"full_html"},"consentRequired":true,"purpose":"","processor":"","processorContact":"","processorUrl":"https:\/\/marine.copernicus.eu\/privacy-policy","processorPrivacyPolicyUrl":"","processorCookiePolicyUrl":"","placeholderMainText":" This content is blocked because Matomo Analytics cookies have not been accepted.","placeholderAcceptText":"Only accept Matomo Analytics cookies."},"prezi":{"uuid":"0ea895db-13e6-4134-9df7-676b05fd694f","langcode":"en","status":true,"dependencies":[],"id":"prezi","label":"Prezi","group":"functional","info":{"value":"\u003Cp\u003EOur website may include pages which embed multimedia content stored on \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/prezi.com\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EPrezi\u003C\/a\u003E, a multimedia presentation platform. For interacting with those videos or presentations you must accept the 3rd party cookies set by Prezi.\u003C\/p\u003E\r\n","format":"full_html"},"consentRequired":true,"purpose":"","processor":"","processorContact":"","processorUrl":"https:\/\/prezi.com\/cookie-policy\/","processorPrivacyPolicyUrl":"","processorCookiePolicyUrl":"","placeholderMainText":"This content is blocked because Prezi cookies have not been accepted.","placeholderAcceptText":"Only accept Prezi cookies."},"recaptcha":{"uuid":"74a72d85-dcce-4a6c-bf1f-f9c6566c4aa1","langcode":"en","status":false,"dependencies":{"enforced":{"module":["cookies_recaptcha"]}},"_core":{"default_config_hash":"kxnI6XQSVY9ud-USFv9E6xhRIvzJgOj0o7koRZ_dID4"},"id":"recaptcha","label":"reCAPTCHA","group":"performance","info":{"value":"\u003Cp\u003EWeb forms are protected against spam and abuse using Google reCAPTCHA, which\u0026nbsp;uses 3rd party cookies to track users\u2019 behaviour across websites. The reCAPTCHA API works by collecting hardware and software information, such as device and application data, and sending this data to Google for analysis. The information collected in connection with your use of the service will be used for improving reCAPTCHA and for general security purposes. It will not be used for personalised advertising by Google. More information here:\u0026nbsp;\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/developers.google.com\/recaptcha\/docs\/faq\u0022 rel=\u0022nofollow ugc\u0022\u003Ehttps:\/\/developers.google.com\/recaptcha\/docs\/faq\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\r\n\r\n\u003Ctable\u003E\r\n\u003Cthead\u003E\r\n\u003Ctr\u003E\r\n\t\u003Cth width=\u002215%\u0022\u003ECookie name\u003C\/th\u003E\r\n\t\u003Cth width=\u002215%\u0022\u003EDefault expiration time\u003C\/th\u003E\r\n\t\u003Cth\u003EDescription\u003C\/th\u003E\r\n\u003C\/tr\u003E\r\n\u003C\/thead\u003E\r\n\u003Ctbody\u003E\r\n\u003Ctr\u003E\r\n\t\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode dir=\u0022ltr\u0022 translate=\u0022no\u0022\u003E_GRECAPTCHA\u003C\/code\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\r\n\t\u003Ctd\u003E6 months\u003C\/td\u003E\r\n\t\u003Ctd\u003EreCAPTCHA sets a necessary cookie (_GRECAPTCHA) when executed for the purpose of providing its risk analysis.\u003C\/td\u003E\r\n\u003C\/tr\u003E\r\n\u003C\/tbody\u003E\r\n\u003C\/table\u003E\r\n","format":"full_html"},"consentRequired":true,"purpose":"","processor":"","processorContact":"","processorUrl":"https:\/\/policies.google.com\/privacy","processorPrivacyPolicyUrl":"","processorCookiePolicyUrl":"","placeholderMainText":"This content is blocked because reCAPTCHA cookies have not been accepted.","placeholderAcceptText":"Only accept reCAPTCHA cookies."},"twitter":{"uuid":"c6497868-e48c-4a85-ab0b-e864194fa7c9","langcode":"en","status":true,"dependencies":{"enforced":{"module":["cookies_twitter_media"]}},"_core":{"default_config_hash":"ih_H55rwW-ZP1TNN6cBzI1uVjlL54uHGVrRqRC07se8"},"id":"twitter","label":"X","group":"functional","info":{"value":"\u003Cp\u003EOur website may include pages with content \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/x.com\/CMEMS_EU\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003Epublished on X\u003C\/a\u003E.\u0026nbsp;By accepting 3rd party cookies from X, formerly known as Twitter, you will get an improved user experience in the form of the embedded X feed.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EX may receive information including the web page you visited, your IP address, browser type, operating system, and cookie information.\u003C\/p\u003E","format":"full_html"},"consentRequired":true,"purpose":"","processor":"","processorContact":"","processorUrl":"https:\/\/help.x.com\/en\/rules-and-policies\/x-cookies","processorPrivacyPolicyUrl":"","processorCookiePolicyUrl":"","placeholderMainText":"This content is blocked because X cookies have not been accepted.","placeholderAcceptText":"Only accept X cookies."},"twitter_ads":{"uuid":"adc1aaf8-6237-407f-8139-e9e3b30fa81e","langcode":"en","status":true,"dependencies":[],"id":"twitter_ads","label":"Twitter Ads","group":"ads","info":{"value":"\u003Cp\u003EOur website may include pages that integrate Twitter Ads to display promotional content and advertisements relevant to your interests. These ads use 3rd party cookies set by Twitter to track user interactions and deliver targeted advertising based on your browsing behavior.\u003C\/p\u003E","format":"full_html"},"consentRequired":true,"purpose":"","processor":"","processorContact":"","processorUrl":"https:\/\/x.com\/en\/privacy","processorPrivacyPolicyUrl":"","processorCookiePolicyUrl":"","placeholderMainText":"This content is blocked because Twitter Ads cookies have not been accepted.","placeholderAcceptText":"Only accept Twitter Ads cookies."},"video":{"uuid":"e615f9a4-6be4-45bd-a1fd-0b891e63f78f","langcode":"en","status":true,"dependencies":{"enforced":{"module":["cookies_video"]}},"_core":{"default_config_hash":"GPtNd6ZPi4fG97dOAJdm_C7Siy9qarY7N93GidYZkRQ"},"id":"video","label":"YouTube","group":"functional","info":{"value":"\u003Cp\u003EOur website may include pages which embed multimedia content stored on\u0026nbsp;\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/youtube.com\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EYouTube\u003C\/a\u003E. For interacting with those videos you must accept the 3rd party cookies set by YouTube.\u003C\/p\u003E\r\n","format":"full_html"},"consentRequired":true,"purpose":"","processor":"","processorContact":"","processorUrl":"https:\/\/policies.google.com\/technologies\/cookies","processorPrivacyPolicyUrl":"","processorCookiePolicyUrl":"","placeholderMainText":"This content is blocked because YouTube cookies have not been accepted.","placeholderAcceptText":"Only accept YouTube cookies."},"videopress":{"uuid":"26f85485-aaca-4bf5-bea2-2df4c81272be","langcode":"en","status":true,"dependencies":[],"id":"videopress","label":"Videopress","group":"functional","info":{"value":"\u003Cp\u003EOur website may include pages which embed multimedia content stored on \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/videopress.com\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EVideopress\u003C\/a\u003E, a multimedia presentation platform. For interacting with those videos or presentations you must accept the 3rd party cookies set by Videopress.\u003C\/p\u003E\r\n\r\n\u003Cp\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003C\/p\u003E\r\n","format":"full_html"},"consentRequired":true,"purpose":"","processor":"","processorContact":"","processorUrl":"https:\/\/automattic.com\/cookies\/","processorPr