t="_self" data-drupal-link-query="{&quot;roadmap_category&quot;:&quot;OMI&quot;}" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/18945">Ocean Monitoring Indicators</a></li><li class="menu-item"> <a href="/user-corner/product-roadmap/transition-information?roadmap_category=service" target="_self" data-drupal-link-query="{&quot;roadmap_category&quot;:&quot;service&quot;}" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/18945">Service</a></li></ul></li><li class="menu-item"> <a href="/services/use-cases/" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/46">Get Inspired</a></li><li class="menu-item menu-item--active-trail"> <a href="/user-corner/service-commitments-and-licence" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/421" class="is-active" aria-current="page">Service Commitments and Licence</a></li><li class="menu-item"> <a href="/contact" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/4570">Contact Us</a></li></ul></li><li class="menu-item"> <a href="/education" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/23155">Education</a></li><li class="menu-item menu-item--expanded"> <a href="/about/" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/3">About</a> <span></span><ul class="menu"><li class="menu-item"> <a href="/about/" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/3">About</a></li><li class="menu-item"> <a href="/about/how-we-work" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/400">How we work</a></li><li class="menu-item"> <a href="/about/observation-requirements" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/2105">Observation requirements</a></li><li class="menu-item"> <a href="/about/producers" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/401">About Producers</a></li><li class="menu-item"> <a href="/about/research-development-projects" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/402">R&amp;D Projects</a></li><li class="menu-item menu-item--expanded"> <a href="/about/service-evolution-strategy" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/403">Service Evolution Strategy</a> <span></span><ul class="menu"><li class="menu-item"> <a href="/about/service-evolution-strategy/cmems-service-evolution-potential-impacts-21-se-call1-projects" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/20499">1st call for tenders</a></li><li class="menu-item"> <a href="/about/service-evolution-strategy/outcome-2nd-cycle-service-evolution-r-projects" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/20501">2nd call for tenders</a></li></ul></li><li class="menu-item"> <a href="/about/stac" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/48">Scientific &amp; Technical Advisory Committee</a></li><li class="menu-item"> <a href="/about/champion-user-advisory-group" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/404">Champion User Advisory Group</a></li><li class="menu-item"> <a href="/services/national-collaboration-programme" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/21398">National Collaboration Programme</a></li><li class="menu-item"> <a href="/services/user-learning-services/blue-book-copernicus-sustainable-ocean" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/6228">Blue Book</a></li><li class="menu-item"> <a href="/about/who-we-work-with" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/406">Who we work with</a></li><li class="menu-item"> <a href="/about/national-marine-stakeholder-forum" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/21336">National Marine Stakeholder Forum</a></li></ul></li></ul> </nav> <nav role="navigation" aria-labelledby="block-topnavigation-2-menu" id="block-topnavigation-2" data-block-plugin-id="system_menu_block:top-navigation" class="ccl-border-top ccl-border-right settings-tray-editable block nav nav--top-navigation block-menu navigation menu--top-navigation ccl-top-navigation-menu" data-drupal-settingstray="editable"><h2 class="block__title visually-hidden _none" id="block-topnavigation-2-menu">Top navigation mobile</h2><ul class="ccl-header-menu-tools menu"><li class="menu-item menu-item--co