--label-hidden field__item"><p>Provides free, open, regular and systematic reference information on the blue (physical), white (sea ice), and green (biogeochemical) ocean state, variability and dynamics across the global ocean and European regional seas.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ccl-container"><div class="region region--footer_disclaimer region-footer-disclaimer"><div id="block-marine-theme-disclaimer" data-block-plugin-id="block_content:15e084a3-2c9f-4437-b07f-4e15177e5c76" class="settings-tray-editable block block-block-content block-block-content15e084a3-2c9f-4437-b07f-4e15177e5c76" data-drupal-settingstray="editable"><h2 class="block__title ccl-block-title--disclaimer">Disclaimer</h2><div class="field field--body field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p> This website provides automated translations of its content through a third-party contractor. These translations are offered solely as a convenience to users and may contain errors, inaccuracies, or inconsistencies. They should not be relied upon for official, legal, or scientific purposes. The original English text published on the website remains the only official and authoritative version.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ccl-footer-bottom"><div class="region region--footer_bottom region-footer-bottom"> <nav role="navigation" aria-labelledby="block-footer-menu-bottom-menu" id="block-footer-menu-bottom" data-block-plugin-id="system_menu_block:footer" class="settings-tray-editable block nav nav--footer block-menu navigation menu--footer ccl-footer-menu" data-drupal-settingstray="editable"><h2 class="block__title visually-hidden" id="block-footer-menu-bottom-menu">Footer</h2><ul class="ccl-footer-legal menu"><li class="menu-item"> <a href="/privacy-policy" class="ccl-link" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/418">Privacy Policy</a></li><li class="menu-item"> <a href="#editCookieSettings" class="ccl-link" target